  "releaseNotes": "#### 🆕 Additions\n- Promoted `ProcessMiddlewareBuilder` to public with `UseMiddleware` and `UseWhen` support\n\n#### ⚙️ Modifications\n- Removed `ProcessInvoker` internal accessors and `invoker.Use...()` extensions\n- Renamed `AddCliInvokeCore`\n- Cleaned up middleware internal API surface\n- Removed unused fields and renamed parameters for clarity in `ProcessInvoker`\n\n#### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n- Fixed test build failures on configuration-seam-stack branch\n- Fixed validation logic in `AddEnumerable(IFormattable)` overload\n- Guarded shell execution against redirected standard input",
